WEBVTT

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.936
One winter, when you had no money,

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:05.296
you mailed her flowers from Paris
because she was having surgery.

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:08.440
One spring in your deepest heartbreak

00:11:08.464 --> 00:11:11.616
she stood with you in the rain
on Fulton Street.

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.616
FB: This isn't your dream, sis.

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:15.096
You can leave him.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:20.640
JM: One winter, one spring,
two decades, two women, one dream.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.696
Your mothers' names are Sheila.

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.136
They quote the Bible, say --

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.376
FB: "You are fearfully
and wonderfully made."

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.656
JM: Say --

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.896
FB: "Boy, it's good
you're done with that MFA."